6", "author": {"steamid": "76561199349952867", "personaname": "LtChenna", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199349952867/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2019, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 494, "playtime_at_review": 187, "last_played": 1787626312, "avatar": "a2cdee8af08145d6ecab9645a67f3f83e26902e1"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a great 3 player Aliens coop shooter. Has a decent amount of lore to it and customization of it is fairly deep.", "timestamp_created": 1759192479, "timestamp_updated": 1759192479, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205495942", "author": {"steamid": "76561199006840856", "personaname": "Ulysses", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199006840856/", "num_games_owned": 374, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 1234, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1055, "deck_playtime_at_review": 441, "last_played": 1766184670, "avatar": "b649cbd600db629bc7f2b3297e2f92ae8a24eff0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is probably the best Alien game I've played. Colonial Marines was tough in a way I didn't find very fun but this is just great. It can get repetitive when played alone (as I always play it), so I don't play much, but I have fun when I do. The gunplay is fantastic, the kills feel quick and punchy. The only thing I dislike is the leveling system where further missions require a higher player level to be playable. Higher levels which require replaying previous missions over and over again to reach. Perhaps if they had a procedurally generated single mission side mode of the marines clearing spaceships, colonies, and other Alien-type locations to make it more fun to level up. Whatever, the game is fun enough as it is now. I will surely be gifting this to my friends so we can all play.", "timestamp_created": 1759176328, "timestamp_updated": 1759176328, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205451807", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006259398", "personaname": "(SOB) Ronan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006259398/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 776, "last_played": 1760936450, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was a fun game to play with friends but... I would NOT buy it at full price. I paid about $5 for the game. And that's about all it is worth. Not because it wasn't fun, but because it was really short and a very linear game play. No exploration at all. It's an Arcade game from the 80\"s", "timestamp_created": 1759121719, "timestamp_updated": 1759121719, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}